.divtube-remote/
android/local.properties
android/.gradle/
android/app/build/
# NOTE: gradle-wrapper.jar is deliberately TRACKED, not ignored. `gradlew`
# cannot bootstrap without it (no `Main-Class` to load => "could not find or
# load main class org.gradle.wrapper.GradleWrapperMain"), so ignoring it made
# every fresh clone unable to build. Committing the wrapper is Gradle's own
# documented guidance and matches the gradlew/gradlew.bat/
# gradle-wrapper.properties files that were already tracked next to it.
# It is a 49 KB Apache-2.0 artifact; its runtime behaviour is pinned by the
# distributionUrl SHA in gradle-wrapper.properties, not by this file.

# Backups
*.bak
.blackboxcli/
*.consolidation-backup
*.healer.bak

# Editor swap / temp files — never commit
*.kate-swp
*.swp
*~

# Stray crash / bug-report artifacts (screenshots & pasted blobs).
# `bug` is an unanchored 1920x1080 PNG screenshot, not source.
/bug
bug.png
Screenshot_*.png
right-or-wrong*.png
